§ `ss 5, 8-8E, 15, 15AA -- which gambling may be offered to me (k080)`

-- k080: Lotto bought online, pre-match and racing bets on a licensed app are lawful; in-play bets on the app, an
-- offshore casino and online scratchies are prohibited; the casino floor is not an interactive service at all.
#ASSERT (`Is it lawful to provide this service to me` `Saturday Lotto bought online from the State lottery (k080)` TRUE) EQUALS `lawful to provide to me: a regulated service whose provider holds a State or Territory licence for it`
#ASSERT (`Is it lawful to provide this service to me` `the casino floor at Crown Perth on payday (k080)` TRUE) EQUALS `outside the Act, because it is not provided as a business over the internet, a phone, broadcasting or datacasting`
#ASSERT (`Is it lawful to provide this service to me` `a licensed betting app, AFL bets placed before the bounce (k080)` TRUE) EQUALS `lawful to provide to me: a regulated service whose provider holds a State or Territory licence for it`
#ASSERT (`Is it lawful to provide this service to me` `the same app, bets placed after the bounce (k080)` TRUE) EQUALS `prohibited: no one may provide it to me while I am in Australia`
#ASSERT (`Is it lawful to provide this service to me` `the same app, bets on the races (k080)` TRUE) EQUALS `lawful to provide to me: a regulated service whose provider holds a State or Territory licence for it`
#ASSERT (`Is it lawful to provide this service to me` `an offshore online casino app (k080)` TRUE) EQUALS `prohibited: no one may provide it to me while I am in Australia`
#ASSERT (`Is it lawful to provide this service to me` `an offshore betting site taking pre-match bets, with no Australian licence` TRUE) EQUALS `unlawful to provide to me: a regulated service whose provider holds no State or Territory licence for it`
#ASSERT (`Is it lawful to provide this service to me` `a licensed bookmaker taking in-play bets by live phone call` TRUE) EQUALS `lawful to provide to me: a regulated service whose provider holds a State or Territory licence for it`
#ASSERT (`Is it lawful to provide this service to me` `instant scratchies sold online by a licensed lottery` TRUE) EQUALS `prohibited: no one may provide it to me while I am in Australia`
#ASSERT (`Is it lawful to provide this service to me` `a soft-drink promotion with an online game of chance` TRUE) EQUALS `outside the Act's prohibitions, because it is a trade promotion gambling service`
#ASSERT (`Is it lawful to provide this service to me` `a pub's networked gaming machines, licensed for that pub` TRUE) EQUALS `lawful to provide to me: a regulated service whose provider holds a State or Territory licence for it`
#ASSERT (`Is it lawful to provide this service to me` `an online keno game that fails the regulations' conditions` TRUE) EQUALS `prohibited: no one may provide it to me while I am in Australia`
#ASSERT (`Is it lawful to provide this service to me` `the same app, bets placed after the bounce (k080)` FALSE) EQUALS `outside the Act's prohibitions while I am outside Australia`

§ `ss 15, 15AA, 69A -- the offences are the provider's, not mine (k080)`

#ASSERT (`Who commits the offence if this service is provided to me` `an offshore online casino app (k080)` TRUE) EQUALS `the provider, not me: the Act's offences and civil penalties fall on whoever provides the service`
#ASSERT (`Who commits the offence if this service is provided to me` `a licensed betting app, AFL bets placed before the bounce (k080)` TRUE) EQUALS `no one under this Act, because providing it to me is not prohibited`

#ASSERT NOT (`Do I commit an offence by gambling with it` `an offshore online casino app (k080)` TRUE)

#ASSERT (`Could I be unable to recover money from this service` `an offshore online casino app (k080)` TRUE) EQUALS `it is an illegal interactive gambling service: regulations under s 69A may void the agreement and bar suing for money won from it, and they are not deposited`
#ASSERT (`Could I be unable to recover money from this service` `an offshore betting site taking pre-match bets, with no Australian licence` TRUE) EQUALS `s 69A does not reach it, because it is not an illegal interactive gambling service`

§ `ss 15C, 15D -- what a betting app may take from me (k080)`

#ASSERT (`May the wagering service take this from me` `a licensed betting app, AFL bets placed before the bounce (k080)` `a credit card` TRUE FALSE) EQUALS `forbidden: the provider must not offer it or accept it from me`
#ASSERT (`May the wagering service take this from me` `a licensed betting app, AFL bets placed before the bounce (k080)` `digital currency` TRUE FALSE) EQUALS `forbidden: the provider must not offer it or accept it from me`
#ASSERT (`May the wagering service take this from me` `a licensed betting app, AFL bets placed before the bounce (k080)` `a debit card or bank transfer` TRUE FALSE) EQUALS `allowed`
#ASSERT (`May the wagering service take this from me` `a licensed bookmaker taking in-play bets by live phone call` `credit from the provider or arranged by it` TRUE TRUE) EQUALS `allowed`
#ASSERT (`May the wagering service take this from me` `a licensed bookmaker taking in-play bets by live phone call` `a credit card` TRUE TRUE) EQUALS `forbidden: the provider must not offer it or accept it from me`
#ASSERT (`May the wagering service take this from me` `Saturday Lotto bought online from the State lottery (k080)` `a credit card` TRUE FALSE) EQUALS `Part 2B does not reach it, because it is not a regulated interactive wagering service`

§ `s 61GB -- what BetStop covers (k081)`

-- k081: the betting apps are covered; Lotto, the casino and gaming machines are not.
#ASSERT `Is it covered by the Register` `a licensed betting app, AFL bets placed before the bounce (k080)` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Is it covered by the Register` `Saturday Lotto bought online from the State lottery (k080)` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Is it covered by the Register` `a pub's networked gaming machines, licensed for that pub` TRUE)

§ `ss 61JA-61JC -- getting on the Register (k081)`

-- k081: Chloe cannot put Jake on the Register; he can, and can name her as his support person.
#ASSERT (`Can I be registered` `Jake applies on 8 May 2046 for 12 months, Chloe his support person (k081)`) EQUALS `yes: the Register operator must register me, within the period set by the Register rules`
#ASSERT (`Can I be registered` `Chloe applies to have Jake registered (k081)`) EQUALS `no: only I can apply to put myself on the Register`
#ASSERT (`Can I be registered` `an application for 2 months`) EQUALS `no: a period in months must be a whole number of at least 3, and a period in years a whole number`
#ASSERT (`Can I be registered` `an application for life`) EQUALS `yes: the Register operator must register me, within the period set by the Register rules`
#ASSERT (`Can I be registered` `an application nominating 6 support persons`) EQUALS `no: I may nominate at most 5 support persons, each of whom has consented`
#ASSERT (`Can I be registered` `an application without the residence statement`) EQUALS `no: the application must state that I am ordinarily resident in Australia`
#ASSERT (`Can I be registered` `an application before identity is verified`) EQUALS `not until the Register operator has carried out the identification procedure`

#ASSERT (`How many support persons may I have`) EQUALS 5

§ `ss 61JF-61JH -- how long it lasts (k081)`

#ASSERT NOT (`Is my registration still in force` `Jake's 12-month registration, Chloe his support person (k081)` 12)
#ASSERT `Is my registration still in force` `Jake's registration extended by 6 months` 12
#ASSERT `Is my registration still in force` `a registration for life` 600
#ASSERT NOT (`Is my registration still in force` `a 3-year registration, no support person` 36)

#ASSERT (`How many days warning of expiry must I get`) EQUALS 14

#ASSERT `Must my support person be warned of expiry` `Jake's 12-month registration, Chloe his support person (k081)`
#ASSERT NOT (`Must my support person be warned of expiry` `a 3-year registration, no support person`)

§ `ss 61JK, 61JM, 61JN -- coming off the Register`

#ASSERT (`Can I come off the Register` `Jake's 12-month registration, Chloe his support person (k081)` `a written application with the declaration, 2 months in`) EQUALS `not yet: no application in the first 3 months of a first registration`
#ASSERT (`Can I come off the Register` `a second registration after an earlier one` `a written application with the declaration, 2 months in`) EQUALS `yes: unless I withdraw it by the end of the seventh day, my entry is removed at the start of the eighth day after I apply`
#ASSERT (`Can I come off the Register` `Jake's 12-month registration, Chloe his support person (k081)` `a written application with the declaration, 4 months in`) EQUALS `yes: unless I withdraw it by the end of the seventh day, my entry is removed at the start of the eighth day after I apply`
#ASSERT (`Can I come off the Register` `Jake's 12-month registration, Chloe his support person (k081)` `a written application without the declaration, 4 months in`) EQUALS `no: the application needs a statutory declaration that I had counselling or advice about it in the last 3 months`
#ASSERT (`Can I come off the Register` `a registration for life` `a written application with the declaration, 4 months in`) EQUALS `yes: unless I withdraw it by the end of the seventh day, my entry is removed at the start of the eighth day after I apply`

#ASSERT NOT (`Has my entry been removed` 7 FALSE)
#ASSERT `Has my entry been removed` 8 FALSE

#ASSERT `Must my support person be told I applied to come off` `Jake's 12-month registration, Chloe his support person (k081)`

#ASSERT `Must my entry be removed on other grounds` TRUE FALSE

§ `ss 61JD, 61KA, 61LA-61LD -- what the betting companies must do once I am registered (k081)`

#ASSERT (`May this service take my bets` `a licensed betting app, AFL bets placed before the bounce (k080)` TRUE TRUE) EQUALS `no: a licensed wagering service must not be provided to me while I am registered`
#ASSERT (`May this service take my bets` `a licensed betting app, AFL bets placed before the bounce (k080)` TRUE FALSE) EQUALS `yes: it is lawful and I am not registered`
#ASSERT (`May this service take my bets` `Saturday Lotto bought online from the State lottery (k080)` TRUE TRUE) EQUALS `yes: the Register does not cover it, because it is not a licensed interactive wagering service`
#ASSERT (`May this service take my bets` `an offshore online casino app (k080)` TRUE TRUE) EQUALS `no: it may not be offered to me in Australia at all`
#ASSERT (`May this service take my bets` `the casino floor at Crown Perth on payday (k080)` TRUE TRUE) EQUALS `the Act does not reach it`

#ASSERT NOT (`May a betting company market to me this way` TRUE `an email, text or other electronic message` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`May a betting company market to me this way` TRUE `physical material only promoting the provider, sent by post` TRUE)
#ASSERT `May a betting company market to me this way` TRUE `physical material only promoting the provider, handed over another way` TRUE
#ASSERT `May a betting company market to me this way` FALSE `an email, text or other electronic message` TRUE

#ASSERT NOT (`May a betting company offer me something to stay off the Register`)

§ `ss 61MA-61MC -- my betting accounts (k081)`

#ASSERT (`When must my account be closed` `Jake's app account, 340 dollars in credit, no bets pending (k081)`) EQUALS `as soon as practicable after I become registered`
#ASSERT (`When must my account be closed` `Jake's app account with a Saturday multi still running (k081)`) EQUALS `as soon as practicable after the last of my outstanding bets is resolved`

#ASSERT (`How much must I be paid when my account is closed` `Jake's app account, 340 dollars in credit, no bets pending (k081)`) EQUALS 340
#ASSERT (`How much must I be paid when my account is closed` `an account with 340 dollars in credit and 40 dollars of deductible debts`) EQUALS 300

#ASSERT NOT (`May my closed account be reopened`)

#ASSERT NOT (`May a new account be opened for me` TRUE)
#ASSERT `May a new account be opened for me` FALSE

